  "name": "Premier Ball League",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "Premier Ball League tournaments are held in Malaysia, Singapore and the Philippines, and in 2025-26 also in Taiwan, Hong Kong, Thailand and Indonesia. Players got a copy with the Premier Ball League logo, Stellar Crown's Fan Rotom and holo Terapagos ex, then Prismatic Evolutions' Budew in 2025-26, and the judges got their own version of Fan Rotom and Budew. In 2025-26 the top four players in Malaysia, the Philippines and Singapore also won a holo Team Rocket's Mewtwo ex.",
